{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the real apocalypse. After Long Night is a sandbox survival RTS where you take on a world completely overrun by the undead. Scavenge a ruined city, build your shelter, and lead a survivor army in the face of overwhelming zombie hordes. Will you fortify your defenses\u2014or strike first? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/7941ae8b9933ef2f57ed689c709ab670.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/7941ae8b9933ef2f57ed689c709ab670.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/d848363cb5ac04ede4fb41d7a24e0356.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/d848363cb5ac04ede4fb41d7a24e0356.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad news: the city's crawling with zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news: the whole place is a goldmine of resources. Skyscrapers? Break them down for bricks and beams. Street signs? Scrap metal. Abandoned cars? Take'em apart and haul the steel home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the apocalypse, &quot;reduce, reuse, recycle&quot; isn't a virtue\u2014it's how you stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/3f1c5365bded05c9c791af678e7272a2.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/3f1c5365bded05c9c791af678e7272a2.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/4221931f7d6d8617e9c1df17c131a5d8.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/4221931f7d6d8617e9c1df17c131a5d8.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear comes from a lack of firepower. But you've got options. Train and command units with distinct roles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frontline gunners mow down the infected, RPG crews blast through zombies, and tanks roll through the undead like a wrecking ball. Let the roar of engines drown out the screams of the damned\u2014because nothing says survival like overwhelming force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/92bf3dfd9c0fc83c7da5586da969dff0.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/92bf3dfd9c0fc83c7da5586da969dff0.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/5ff660e46b7e14bd386459684739f17c.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/5ff660e46b7e14bd386459684739f17c.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No civilians to please. No happiness meters. Just survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put every idle hand to work\u2014craft weapons, grow crops, cook food, and build defenses. Raise walls, mount turrets, and create a safe haven sturdy enough to survive the endless nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/05da028bad1ea7047e06cc7cecc2cf5d.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/05da028bad1ea7047e06cc7cecc2cf5d.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the radar turns red and the dead flood your gates, it's do-or-die time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your defense: deploy barricades, place towers, organize units into specialized squads, and launch coordinated assaults. Infantry, tanks, artillery\u2014your tactics decide who walks away from this fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/77ccf58d912b268aeba145435c0dc09d.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/77ccf58d912b268aeba145435c0dc09d.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of fighting tooth and nail? Try Challenge or Endless modes\u2014or go wild in Cheat Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn unlimited units, build the impossible, and bomb the zombie hordes just for fun. Or start your own post-apocalyptic cricket tournament. No rules. No mercy. Just chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351650?t=1757670122","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/a4056f21dfd8f4cbd7529fe6e211d82d1dd8fbf8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757670122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/2c38403c4b78430b1ba0f5a78b5287c6a6e42b83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757670122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/2c38403c4b78430b1ba0f5a78b5287c6a6e42b83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757670122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3473030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Survive the apocalypse. Fight the zombie hordes!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord\uff01<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/a48c62563865d5d7cd98972ec5cbec00.avif?t=1757670122\" width=630 height=216 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the real apocalypse. After Long Night is a sandbox survival RTS where you take on a world completely overrun by the undead. Scavenge a ruined city, build your shelter, and lead a survivor army in the face of overwhelming zombie hordes. Will you fortify your defenses\u2014or strike first? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu