defenses. Raise walls, mount turrets, and create a safe haven sturdy enough to survive the endless nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/05da028bad1ea7047e06cc7cecc2cf5d.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/05da028bad1ea7047e06cc7cecc2cf5d.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the radar turns red and the dead flood your gates, it's do-or-die time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your defense: deploy barricades, place towers, organize units into specialized squads, and launch coordinated assaults. Infantry, tanks, artillery\u2014your tactics decide who walks away from this fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/77ccf58d912b268aeba145435c0dc09d.poster.avif?t=1757670122\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351650/extras/77ccf58d912b268aeba145435c0dc09d.webm?t=1757670122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of fighting tooth and nail? Try Challenge or Endless modes\u2014or go wild in Cheat Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn unlimited units, build the impossible, and bomb the zombie hordes just for fun. Or start your own post-apocalyptic cricket tournament. No rules. No mercy. Just chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Jiangzuogongfang Shanghai Game Co.,Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Str